        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal of heat dissipation system with floor heating</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal of heat dissipation system with floor heating
Disposal of components for the heat dissipation system;
UUID: 4cdc7c6b-fed6-435a-8aa3-94c69cbfbdc2
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps. Transport of raw materials to the plant.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on average input from different call of bids for the heating system used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4cdc7c6b-fed6-435a-8aa3-94c69cbfbdc2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
